  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      15
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        What I learned
      </h2>

      <p>
        SCANMILL 3D showed me that flexible manufacturing is not only about
        making a robot reproduce a predefined trajectory.
      </p>

      <p>
        A more adaptive manufacturing system can use measurement of the real
        component to modify the manufacturing process itself.
      </p>

      <p>
        The project also connected several fields that strongly interest me:
        robotics, mechanical design, machining, 3D reconstruction and industrial
        automation.
      </p>

